56f89315f86d3813b502130a21d48ac674b6a6d16dfcb2220f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target purifies all diseases and poisons, turning them into healing effects.","source_tag":"_t","target":"目标净化所有毒素和疾病效果，并将它们转化为治疗。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"208c38ce14d1f56b4203bc44aaa6dae34c48164d687601cedcaf70daaec0063e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8668d3e738f58c4de0b234368f825c57f045c11527c720175e2cac1e355d3106","logical_entry_identity":"072483a2907226b18e06d043e022b08e725433d8041a3818e81545f9b85ccf9c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Spine of the World","source_tag":"_t","target":"世界之脊"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"43c608c4f5e037e372d2f7007842f25672a7499d29d09166ee314303ce14f33c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"866c0baa29bd23aa4461fb880ac6192998ed8278a313549d8a18df72d7d79ba3","logical_entry_identity":"bb453e505251f2dd8fb0edbd693b62ee55760d744e7df81f9fbef42692818f70","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rassir's journal part 3","source_tag":"_t","target":"拉希尔的旅行日记 第三部分"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e254db67b7d14dc2329df60c9a0d4e459a2465066d27590ef1910e93b96229f4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"866f1779065329ef731fc008f2d34e3afdad4b026274b96b3e3b240cda4bc2fa","logical_entry_identity":"89a8ad7fe2c235e943c354bb6b617c5efb682cb4b4c5de1f73b5bbe5f68e1ae9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"kidney","source_tag":"_t","target":"肾脏"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"512c9291dc78c2dc332388781d1ba32eab4ce4fbd16e1e163a6e12fd449c5e76","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8674481408136db9c387806bb21e1921348b10e4ae19595c71009d93268525de","logical_entry_identity":"f183fd1fbd98e024fda12d29c5b0cb71ac9c2d9bfc140b7fc91a4a66e6e21f72","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Creates a gravity spike in a radius of %d that moves all targets towards the spell's center and inflicts %0.2f physical (gravity) damage.\n\t\tEach target moved beyond the first increases the damage by %0.2f (up to a maximum of %0.2f bonus damage).\n\t\tTargets take reduced damage the further they are from the epicenter (20%% less per tile).\n\t\tThe damage dealt will scale with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在半径 %d 范围内制造一个重力钉刺，将所有目标牵引至法术中心，造成 %0.2f 物理（重力）伤害。\n\t\t从第二个单位起，每牵引一个单位将会使伤害增加 %0.2f (最多增加 %0.2f 额外伤害)。\n\t\t离法术中心越远，目标受到的伤害越少（每格减少 20%%）。\n\t\t受法术强度影响，伤害按比例加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c393f9ebb2bf760b5ce05b362c940e198876df9a81df2ba442a02176eadbf96e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"867c86b919b02a9b661d60506f9b70292f0036ba8b070a89cdcf6a3468c18476","logical_entry_identity":"27c7b3a8e581251e4995d0e248421605e438229b6a67a80ba4fce543e6b161fd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"stone","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"919ca298c03bbaf2eeca47a9a8c47b446481c41a79012503834975bbaf293a95","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"867d0a415be3869f65e90244cc96e1f42b0895f8774e71d051a4cc1366a3dc07","logical_entry_identity":"e86f4f0d8c72fc1755feeb6576add1bcbfe24d6f75a45a77d1acc85a58e9f060","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"These titanic boots appear to have been carved from stone. They appear weathered and cracked, but easily deflect all blows.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这对巨大的靴子似乎是用石头雕刻而成的，尽管已经风化破裂，但仍旧能抵抗一切伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d3b15170359e88e72bbc1c562b71afc202d958f4961ca4dc8335cb7ddb8e7bd6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"867d77eb5bef9211ed4dcfa99d9cf0daafdb25df7ed185029219a860d54562ef","logical_entry_identity":"fec9aaca6c4456c512efcc51ff3f8623b9f03712b80c311ac6704a15354760fd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_RED#As you enter you notice the trap door has no visible handle on the inside. You are stuck here!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#LIGHT_RED#当你进入了地道你发现活门没有出去的开关，你被关在这里了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"db18130fd77db9648265c327956e6c72615a97a73808c017cde481d2788559c2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"867f389acca2a871703950cf9596c2c426b3fa5c3be3770d61356ebba9847c83","logical_entry_identity":"c99dda96dd8b1cadc4195c972e225699e1f6f18a76fc9c173527471f2ff257f2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The staff carver spends a great deal of time going over the finer details of staff combat with you%s.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"制杖师花了大量时间与你一同推敲法杖格斗的精妙细节%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c62ca2b3b03cab0d383795f1f42902c97c71beacef997b10ac69eb11a381e290","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86839ead9dc11e0544874342adb9bb4129db308945373bfac4e27c83572faf63","logical_entry_identity":"4b0937ce1d1cc8f830f7b52101028724a962e954e7aedec97456e1358a3a6238","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rej Arkatis","source_tag":"entity name","target":"瑞吉·阿卡提斯"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"63f196675da62582f8e64376e6590be77bab52cdef7b6433b407128f848ac3e8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"868409df55e455920fbc14bd92d597a335ccbf4ce5729ce06adb69e3b9e8a001","logical_entry_identity":"fa6c5b3e06bc9582d3dd845d2645021a9832c583ec28b6a792cc2245be664dde","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"giant boulder trap","source_tag":"entity name","target":"滚石陷阱"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"70973938b619084ff3b37cb95e0ebeb10361c27a552dab79eb443a9d840e2b58","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86895e72c4f94410db89c60ff1e38e420a2f032d1f70abc76af84d4f347c69fc","logical_entry_identity":"cde6ff1952a079100234e42b32dc0b8cc657f92a4ba36e48077c44e7226187b9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Taints are not class abilities, you must find them or learn them from other people.","source_tag":"_t","target":"污印不是职业技能，你必须找到它们或从其他人那获得它们。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1cea79faf3da03a119423124b888c7d73e15f2cd2c419436cf89031f10ad97a9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"868c6f6f61d5bfb2697b2392bc6a57adec9b97eae7041af112a5987506b06072","logical_entry_identity":"b3207d15b9d4d268fba6bb7bc048a19207349ab4895c5a13f95b460fe0e4a1dd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"generic resist blight","source_tag":"entity name","target":"通用 提升枯萎抗性"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50b1df3de6b7d43008da2107b3b20954a28b41bd3b6789f0e2f5d1fa5e41259d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"868d191a813f153cb1bddd2346a30a24544d8d9a0101c9474dc8b93cf7e67063","logical_entry_identity":"25bf53d96f9bfe993bb9902acdd929a5aa9c1f8b0567012bdd6bf99621a26aa6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot tumble to that space.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你不能翻筋斗到这个地点。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5b47ee2321b69d129c0c3752235feb59404525d0f54f82511c38682bf953e20a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"868f79b23b8d01b7036c58466feb20423c98134c0657f2d3aef9430c5f178862","logical_entry_identity":"ed07dca147479e5c6408357bee20fd4787e51018f7c79125307babab58872c46","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is on fire, taking %0.2f fire damage per turn and %d%% chance per turn of removing a physical or magical effect from all targets affected by Inferno, Burning Wake or Cleansing Flames.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标受到灼烧效果，每回合受到 %0.2f 火焰伤害，并每回合有 %d%% 几率移除被地狱火、无尽之焰或净化之焰影响的生物身上的一个物理或魔法效果。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"346fee3f720ef9a1592297b3476d36dc18a6f585cbd478bd3338a7b9a7a0a76d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8690f53d0c0cc62e44dca711fe651cd70fde1166b0997e55818ea9f22ffcdc9e","logical_entry_identity":"cd1d3ee3d6e6fc66745b1362824b54033b7be2ce4b5ed7a1b3c1ab3c50ac2252","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A farportal is a way to travel incredible distances in the blink of an eye. They usually require an external item to use. You have no idea if it is even two-way.\nThis one seems to go to the Far East, a continent of which only rumours are known...","source_tag":"_t","target":"传送门是可以在眨眼间将你传送出很远距离的工具。它们通常需要一件关键道具来激活。你不知道这道门是否为双向的。\n这道门似乎通向远东大陆，一块传说中的大陆……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7896d743948d09817459f18a964992a5a11b9370c7a39505e28888014a719bef","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8691054640e146fc1b908a19ebb7953691725c52845f0e99fab29fb9e80bb033","logical_entry_identity":"f91f8b0ed1f3892d1e1bd8b3b1080775645b17481dc52cc787667d4549be822d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Each time a creature affected by vimsense hurts you, you regain %0.2f vim and %0.2f health.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"每当被活力感知发现的敌人攻击你时，你回复 %0.2f 活力值和 %0.2f 生命值。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5554b1dd9f031904a02170e46ed35df3c56cff5f20e4c5ff3250bde51f6d56f5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8699336521d17596ebe80e16fc39b03fdae0bad66e11584ca5d96bb45289ed93","logical_entry_identity":"9e0c1b208cabf0f4e7e05e4332af6d4c62d79518299268af381880fb3e459a20","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"summoning (distance)","source_tag":"talent type","target":"召唤（远程）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e38f7192e7fd143926eae01a03d38790fd0197994089770ca60ca7f1105099f6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"869a8d378198d48ab64b9935d12cec2a3bab091c362c0b7b8c576315f97875e9","logical_entry_identity":"52d93fde2308689531a276fafa61d5754d25848ba9478e13dfa58371eb70b340","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Activate to create a resonance field that will absorb 50%% of all damage you take (%d max absorption).  The field will not interfere with Feedback gain.\n\t\tThe max absorption value will scale with your Mindpower, and the effect lasts up to ten turns.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"激活此技能可产生一个吸收所受全部伤害 50%% 的共鸣领域（最大吸收值 %d）。此领域不会干扰反馈值的增长。\n\t\t最大吸收值受精神强度加成。\n\t\t此技能最多维持 10 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5dde30192fb66f1d4885b8a5f3f84e24713e39af8268e9f1f5a223906b8f0910","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"869f483095d4cd1c3788a59ec6d49a8fba878527bccb734f36c07de94133ee79","logical_entry_identity":"a7c6bff339723914cbe79663dd062b02502cbc4465115587ca26a3dc91953f7c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*Before you stands a Human clothed in black robes. He seems to be ignoring you.*#WHITE#\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*You stand inside some kind of summoning circle, which prevents you from moving.*#WHITE#\nOh yes! YES, one more for my collection. My collection, yes. A powerful one indeed!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*在你面前站着一个穿着黑色长袍的人类，他目前似乎无视了你。*#WHITE#\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*你站在一个召唤法阵里，没法移动。*#WHITE#\n啊，对！好！又一件我的收藏品，没错，的确是很强力的一个！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1c0d30318390587d7bf058f2c513dc053d9420d66b2cb0a693cec55578e96ad5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86a23cd6d21272b4a905ca78591972c1ecb1e15ca8f303db456d24f4fe62bad6","logical_entry_identity":"568d59cff8a5722552c6a50d12048acf6812c7cf85e54dcab6afab3455836b0e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"From 1 to 4","source_tag":"_t","target":"从 1 到 4"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"545ffacd979bae79805f17208b49e506730928cdf89719a9aa49e9fab9d6e577","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86a7321f7ebea5cfde21c726c635dc5c64896c175706f760ba223f9b41c71b13","logical_entry_identity":"e5b1428972c368d3a11ffce0a1717e750eb0454b7d0e05e3f87087bf73fb60aa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fear not. Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared. Oh, take this. #LIGHT_GREEN#*He hands you a key*#WHITE# It opens the ruins of Telmur, which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago. If you happen to find a text in the ruins entitled \"Inverted and Reverted Probabilistic Fields\", return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically.","source_tag":"_t","target":"别害怕，几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了。哦，带上这个。#LIGHT_GREEN#*他交给你一把钥匙。*#WHITE#它可以打开泰尔玛废墟，那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方。要是你在废墟之中找到一份标题是《反转与复原概率场》的文献，请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"852685892918d1ad5f87bbe4fc742da56caf05ae04cbb953feca46eda8ac7953","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86ac25a874f07d1f35aed6c1a16a4568f0fe039bdb00f1768902e2084a4f5589","logical_entry_identity":"f8b89d912ba6b7a35c32b7e2134f994094cfc0ce9e61090ea03f6c20eff19c79","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"blast the opponent's mind dealing %d mind damage and silencing them for 4 turns","source_tag":"tformat","target":"冲击敌人精神，造成 %d 精神伤害并沉默4回合"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be6ed028e2ef3d161ee4233121242bf4c6b289e3ef47ed75659bb2c102b32376","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86aeae2f5363ad489c6efd962aaabc18fd172c64b1018d1796daeadb742417ed","logical_entry_identity":"5965b6b45c49b9aee9cbda9b5370b4024afe5b42a99b6468405d9f89a16085f7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"\n#YELLOW#Newly prepared traps are put on cooldown.#LAST#","source_tag":"_t","target":"\n#YELLOW#新准备的陷阱进入冷却。#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ee65ef0995bee388090378ba4220d6cd549e2fe0b28511022cd5cc581093d58f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86b01ce4f3a363181ce9c6d4c1b83d2e109e393efffa6cfe280714150382026d","logical_entry_identity":"adecd6d8e1ed7c72daa4b901ae89dd7348e9941d9b25297af11c1ce51ed1ed07","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}#Clinician Korbek's experimental notes part one#{normal}#\n\nWhat a dread and woeful task I have been given - the revival of our race. The swine humans and halflings have destroyed our whole society, and only the brutes of the military remain to rule our people. We are left with just a handful of women left, and without drastic measures we shall soon be extinct.\n\nAnd those drastic measures come down to me. I am the sole orc left with any advanced medical knowledge, as I evacuated to the East before our settlement was wiped out. I must find a way to prolong the lives of our remaining females and have them breed at far faster rates. I will use all natural and magical means at my disposal.\n\nI have taken this cavern up as a secret base, far away from the main encampment. I must do dark deeds here, and I wish them to remain hidden...","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}#巫医库贝克的实验报告：一#{normal}#\n\n复兴我们的种族——我接下的是多么可怕而悲惨的使命。那群猪猡般的人类与半身人彻底摧毁了我们的整个社会，只剩下军方的粗鄙武夫来统治我们的人民。我们仅剩下寥寥几名女性，若不采取极端手段，我们很快便将灭绝。\n\n而这些极端手段全系于我一身。在我们的聚居地被彻底抹杀之前，我便已撤退至远东，因此我是现存唯一掌握高深医术的兽人。我必须寻得一种方法来延长残存雌性的寿命，并让她们以极快的速度繁衍后代。我将动用我所能支配的一切自然与魔法手段。\n\n我将这处远离主营地的洞穴辟为秘密据点。我必须在此行见不得光的黑暗之举，而我希望这一切永远不为人知……"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bd70e25d5c9cbf581d2381f6390f3e6aa4d3b17df609dc52129c635177338a03","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86b086e1241def8ab97286381342d0005a91c896ec06301866ab466d876cf5b5","logical_entry_identity":"4b889b4775c31eb7d7222c95fb34ada3bc270496fc7747bd902d8322d33bd3bb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ritches Tunnels","source_tag":"_t","target":"里奇通道"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1d9e792f749173f35497fb0dce3964a8552cea20ad1b2fe38036c326c0dc04fb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86bc67b37f83902470b361c150dcf5f7411860dba28a06b749423d076bfbc984","logical_entry_identity":"87277786ea006b291c11a7e8865f8538ca5f52db152fd7708ccbbe707ed043d7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"flip the hourglass (sands currently flowing towards %s)","source_tag":"tformat","target":"翻转沙漏(沙子目前流向%s)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"12a5d72d44527618d827c01a2aebdca5662e553a10f2501fd1b64aa4ab8a6677","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86be15184889b53230b1bf9efde1c386fa820457057a65725eacbaebb54261a0","logical_entry_identity":"5a490b571ccee460b3a4873ff0d078b194627fe80680793422c5349554f21cae","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD##{bold}#Use mouse to move#WHITE##{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD##{bold}#鼠标点击移动#WHITE##{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ee28eab9998168167168cd8d514f6f6530ebc7223c6f9a1f5ea678421779bd39","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"86c40dc2f90d4b829e9111279e109296886cf9495eae875e9772c4399e41570c","logical_entry_identity":"40eb100be44dc71e2969b87b56010c7c36eaf815054d92292de053bcfd6a3c3d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An old tale about the fear of magic.","source_tag":"_t","target":"有关魔法的恐怖的古老传说。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8a455c5200e02fc0ab5386ac930598459f06c863ac41104cdb8077918a3d42cf","compo