":"_t","target":"第二套武器：大部分武器使用主手抓握。按 X 键切换武器套。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0620f7c17a1c0ba5913aad51a07dcf85ca94345b018c0e63d412ff833a608750","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"871e009794665ebde99db479326af05498db08e1d940411e4fb7de6168ef7f0b","logical_entry_identity":"99777ed83e9b6d2709b781d4e910f7237b49050296c8c1e10f05b017733883e6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s's mind recovers from the domination.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s 的精神摆脱了支配。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7f82f81a88f4fc6da6a02252d7dfa264b1c580b5d810a52e8678eaa34777d32a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"871e1e25e0617fa469a387fdb892ab3c242301cb49bb3075f0f87d46ea7ce708","logical_entry_identity":"16adea500a25028c7052add528d743cc262972a709d41fcc0b41d94b0e23d49d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# is poisoned numbing blight!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#中了麻痹枯萎毒素！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"09091e49cd7df5a10b6cb2a95b6b03c94d3a4c0a238e543f6cd2656e333308fd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"872240fa12e54098c71bb506a50db50a53498c6e0e248ea44f31cda3e5ffc21d","logical_entry_identity":"9cae551bb274e5d3ee4b24bb8b105d6063fd35d105ba7213fcbebef611dcd98a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This spider seems to command the flow of mana, which pulses freely through its body.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只蜘蛛善于控制法力流动，它可以使法力在它体内有节奏的跳跃。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1d3632a4391f48a6460122b0dae72f781b39685672f0141a2b272033c52174a7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"87279b1f87254c0b4d3a15dddb182af3116fe880845b4380110e833a96f9c51c","logical_entry_identity":"88e3c551156be939fd1899282ad5fb946fb7f45606aa347e6ab63132952cf7a1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"iron gauntlets","source_tag":"entity name","target":"铁臂铠"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c3cf063bd126a4b3d7db80e40d9f6635d66503b99256fc991d8a59081aa4e3fe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"872a63760f1f71922ed197e1728130de79defa3f90bb84a1f174c402190b740a","logical_entry_identity":"f105ecf87f268a582169d0538fe19fb346e4b70cf5c82155d45d861ff9ca7472","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"venom","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"毒液"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a78216b7dc61a30779d5a85aa3159489078242d32d3287cf6d6d408a717f4878","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"872a7b5caa3d0434f7dde9ca7a6ce173a2bf4b767ce0a73713c7dffda2c573bf","logical_entry_identity":"b264f7eefc6bc941b165dbb2f14524505fc9e5e01ba4f91b303e0d532a2cd672","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This giant golem was constructed by the Halflings during the Pyre Wars to fight the orcs, but was felled by Garkul the Devourer. Someone foolish has tried to reconstruct it, but has lost control of it, and now it rampages in search of its original creators, who are long dead. Its body is made of marble, its joints of solid voratun, and its eyes of purest ruby. At over 40 feet tall, it towers above you, and its crimson orbs seem to glow with rage.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只巨大的傀儡是半身人在烈火战争期间为对抗兽人而建造的，但被吞噬者加库尔击倒。某个愚蠢的家伙试图重建它，却已失去对它的控制，如今它横冲直撞，寻找早已死去的制造者们。它的躯体由大理石制成，关节由坚固的沃瑞钽制成，眼睛则由最纯净的红宝石构成。它足有四十多英尺高，像铁塔般耸立在你面前，猩红的眼眸似乎闪烁着怒火。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}